 "id_str": "1908549472407421425",
 "text": "Cheat code # 3 = Bull / Bear Flags ✅\n\nHere's the cheat sheet ⬇️\n\nFocus on Bull Flags above the Previous Day High\n\nFocus on Bear Flags below the Previous Day Low\n\nLearn to spot the flags! They are one of the most simple and reliable chart patterns out there 👇 https://t.co/xyyuMn4KyB",
