  "id_str": "1908549470234767650",
  "text": "You will notice that balanced or \"range days\" will be showing little to no EMA trend.\n\nWhen these 3 EMA's are too tightly spaced it's simply showing a lack of momentum to one side.\n\nIn other words we are consolidating and it's time to stay patient and wait for more confirmation. https://t.co/QtnOTDLdZY",
